   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Pixel art video game sprite animation. A drowned station security diver seen from behind: the smooth rounded back of a dark-teal metal helmet, a squat charcoal air tank strapped high between broad tan shoulder pads, the back of a heavy dark-teal and charcoal hard diving suit, a charcoal belt, big dark grey gloved hands, dark boots with tan soles, back view seen from directly behind, back of the head visible, face hidden, draws a short stubby dark gunmetal harpoon pistol from the holster on its right hip and snaps its right arm out straight to aim the pistol forward, holds the aim, then puts the pistol back on its hip, exactly as the control motion shows; the feet stay planted and it never moves across the frame. The camera is completely static and locked off: no zoom, no pan, no rotation. The character stays centred and the same size, keeps facing the same direction the whole time, never turns around, and the whole body stays in frame. Plain flat white background, no shadow, no ground, crisp pixel art, flat colours, no motion blur."
   ]
  },
